  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "00a7f5cd-893e-435f-84b4-b31def99cb49",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute e leia a frase. Repare que a pessoa está descrevendo uma tendência da própria rotina.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0ae95cd0-06a1-459b-b6d1-94acc2c61d18",
          "textContent": "<p>Olhe a cena, escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>Tiendo a revisar el celular antes de dormir.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Costumo olhar o celular antes de dormir.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fab3bf3b29b649a495e2eceb58dbf4ed_b02-night-phone-routine.png?Expires=1794099726&Signature=Yg0QCtHEfSuqtLgDHe2oUVwl8pXQSqkbsgPihGV61mXK78vt3FRpNIdCpRrXnzoY9cRkpl~pnTkt7G5oae3h-dUinhuxlO60zERLUEeY5teXdCz-GGv5-Ez060sQD~Liu8T34p8mz17oSJ1HDB90B2hrVpCegsSauKUzzRoNIUVTKVUmIyA83SQnKei2nP541yXEYdGucRIBGU6HlQ4Iqhkfcd2lik2Pa4ZMikUCKnAJpce5Xp43XfkRzXC~AFiRl9pNL0LXsvtbRDAHOXZh7f9besCx2g-onC8ySkzOhgIfmlcqTbEUB5zDshBnIZ7qjqOmI3G5R2BqMrFNttdRDQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/af6144d1d73e42ddacea77f945eec783_b02-tiendo-a-revisar-el-celular-antes-de-dormir.mp3?Expires=1794099726&Signature=0bv6GhNxRsW~vhVaxFMXSzSMcEmbPu-C41qr-82Rt1R~lWeizwxqiYDhLhXl1w9y28dqx~rZsr-KqwLZj6J-byQX5KdKgSCpEoP8QcyK-c6olLCVzpLbOS0kwJHUQvE4g0SECJkANIl4tk9rQuGjDqoBZarU4bPJgfKI61MeWFUtFiHi28juh3gtNdOIRkrEJ-zsXZV78uL3fksYdHz2D7Gf8kgFfv7piq~DJhfxU-3~77UEozzC99ttlkZLfV2UTtllLUkUHd1fw8Zqi4~1aTotoajJ3QlV8G3OEbRy-26rz5NhNsJhStOY035MOklDH8hwZClM14F9aqkRTKvOsQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
